      },
      "EcologyCombat": {
        "Despawn": "The guardian withdraws when its ecological anchor is lost or challengers leave for too long.",
        "Bestiary0": "The true antlers glow steadily; reflections are harmless. Dodge committed mirror lines and retaliate when a white weak-point ring appears.",
        "Spawn0": "Defeat Eye of Cthulhu, then create a Mistmirror Grove. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Mistmirrored Branch Crown at night. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary1": "Its finite wax shell never restores body health. Candle rows leave an opening, and the coffin drop ends in a vulnerable recovery.",
        "Spawn1": "Defeat Eater of Worlds or Brain of Cthulhu, then create a Waxsleep Court. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Unquenched Wax Seal at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary2": "A six-legged beast carrying a living hive. Break its back-hive to expose the core, destroy honey sacs before they burst, and thin its limited guards.",
        "Spawn2": "Defeat Queen Bee, then create a Amberhive Thicket. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Honeysealed Brood Sac at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary3": "A low wave, falling bones, then a sound blade: every bell has a visible warning. The clapper sweep leaves ample time to move.",
        "Spawn3": "Defeat Skeletron, then create a Knellbone Moor. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Silent Hanging Bell at night. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary4": "Cold armor is slow and hard; overheating is fast and vulnerable. Breaking a radiator exposes the heart. Its fire never changes terrain.",
        "Spawn4": "Defeat Wall of Flesh, then create a Backburn Wastes. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Inverted Ember at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary5": "Treads, magnets, repair drones and hover guns reconfigure in turns. Destroy drones to expose the core; repairs replenish limited armor, never health.",
        "Spawn5": "Defeat all three mechanical bosses, then create a Wildmachine Soil. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Failed Master Controller at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary6": "Its mouths fire independently. Break a root knot to remove its temporary wall. Digestive sacs never steal inventory or permanently imprison players.",
        "Spawn6": "Defeat Plantera, then create a Hungerbloom Garden. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Unripe Hungerfruit at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary7": "Sun marks link in sequence. Its backplate opens after a charge, exposing the core. The encounter never starts a solar eclipse.",
        "Spawn7": "Defeat Golem, then create a Sunken-Sun Domain. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Cooled Sunwheel at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary8": "The tidal stance follows curves; the prism stance forms light arrays. Bubbles display both refracted segments in advance. Neither dry land nor daytime is punished.",
        "Spawn8": "Defeat both Duke Fishron and Empress of Light, then create a Rainbow Abyss. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Harmonic Tide Pearl at any time. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "Bestiary9": "The empty carapace follows visible star orbits. Gates move only encounter bullets. Break discarded armor to clear a lane and punish the dive recovery.",
        "Spawn9": "Defeat Moon Lord, then create a Formless Starsoil. Enable ecology mode with at least 600 matching tiles and use Derailed Star Marker at night. This optional branch has no expiry.",
        "MobBestiary0": "Its frontal mirror shell reduces damage; flank it.",
        "MobBestiary1": "Orbits before diving toward an earlier mark.",
        "MobBestiary2": "Leaves a harmless reflection, then lunges along its warning.",
        "MobBestiary3": "Pauses clearly between two straight charges.",
        "MobBestiary4": "Briefly accelerates when struck.",
        "MobBestiary5": "Protected while cocooned, then circles and dives.",
        "MobBestiary6": "Slowly casts sticky waxfire globes.",
        "MobBestiary7": "Layered wax shields a rare chrysalis that spits bounded broods.",
        "MobBestiary8": "Stops to feed before advancing; sugar armor protects the front.",
        "MobBestiary9": "Locks on before firing a single honey needle.",
        "MobBestiary10": "A branch disguise hides two consecutive lunging slashes.",
        "MobBestiary11": "Slowly releases a limited number of brood volleys.",
        "MobBestiary12": "Its low sound wave can be jumped over.",
        "MobBestiary13": "Briefly orbits, then dives quickly.",
        "MobBestiary14": "The visible bell wave always leaves an upward opening.",
        "MobBestiary15": "Three fixed bone volleys end in a long pause.",
        "MobBestiary16": "Frontal ash armor leaves its rear vulnerable.",
        "MobBestiary17": "Fire rises upward from the moth.",
        "MobBestiary18": "Roots itself before thrusting a short charcoal spike.",
        "MobBestiary19": "Its furnace back cools between paired charges.",
        "MobBestiary20": "Runs, stops, then fires a rivet.",
        "MobBestiary21": "Circles with magnetic leaves spread, then pierces an old target.",
        "MobBestiary22": "Its slow wire volley has a long recovery.",
        "MobBestiary23": "Locks its guns before consecutive bursts.",
        "MobBestiary24": "Roots itself and shows an aiming line before opening its mouth.",
        "MobBestiary25": "A floral disguise gives way to two quick slashes.",
        "MobBestiary26": "Its slow seed sac has a long warning.",
        "MobBestiary27": "Root webs are temporary hazards, never real placed web tiles.",
        "MobBestiary28": "Sun plates protect its front; retaliate after both charges.",
        "MobBestiary29": "All three legs stop before a short laser locks on.",
        "MobBestiary30": "Follows a curve, then pierces a committed point.",
        "MobBestiary31": "Its left and right coffin doors fire in sequence.",
        "MobBestiary32": "Swims briefly through air before a committed stab.",
        "MobBestiary33": "Expanding gauze releases spaced, slow light globes.",
        "MobBestiary34": "An arc of light marks its return route.",
        "MobBestiary35": "This rare dragon warns before two scattered bubble volleys.",
        "MobBestiary36": "Its shell blocks frontal attacks; it occasionally hops over obstacles.",
        "MobBestiary37": "After teleporting, it warns again before firing.",
        "MobBestiary38": "A visible orbit announces its approach and dive.",
        "MobBestiary39": "The rift line appears well before its committed dive."
      }
    }
  }
}
